# Project contract

`AGENTS.md` is the single source of truth. Read it before any code change.

Key invariants:

- Desktop-only, min width `1024px`; primary acceptance `1280px` / `1440px`.
- `main` is protected. Required checks on the exact head:
  `static`, `unit`, `e2e`, `production-smoke`, `code-intelligence`.
- Node.js `>= 24.20.0`. PostgreSQL 18 is production truth; SQLite is legacy-import only.
- Stack versions follow `package.json` / `package-lock.json` and
  `docs/reference/tech-stack-official-docs.md` (Vite 6, TS 5.9, Express 4, React 19).
- Do not touch `.env`, `data/`, `dist*/`, uploads, or dumps.
- Plans are reviewed before code. Do not start coding an unsettled plan.
